  "steps": [
    "Place the whole chicken in a large pot with the onion and all the whole spices. Cover with water, bring to a boil, then simmer 45-60 minutes until the chicken is fully cooked. Reserve the broth.",
    "Remove the chicken, let it cool slightly, then shred or joint the meat.",
    "In a separate pot, brown the ground beef with ground cinnamon until cooked, then set aside.",
    "Cook the basmati rice in the reserved chicken broth (about 1.5x rice volume in liquid) until fluffy.",
    "Toast the mixed nuts and raisins in a dry pan or with a touch of oil until golden.",
    "For the garlic lemon sauce: blend the garlic, olive oil, and lemon juice until emulsified.",
    "To serve: layer the rice, top with shredded chicken, the spiced ground beef, and the toasted nut mix. Drizzle with garlic lemon sauce."
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Whole spices are available at any spice shop or the Carrefour spice section."
